==History==
2016  
*42 cards were present in [[Version_History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016, with 14 {{Rarity|Common}} cards, 14 {{Rarity|Rare}} cards and 14 {{Rarity|Epic}} cards.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]] added Level caps for [[Friendly Battle|Friendly Battles]] and [[Tournament|Tournaments]]: [[King's Tower]]: 8; {{Rarity|Common}}: 8; {{Rarity|Rare}}: 6; {{Rarity|Epic}}: 3.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]] added the {{Rarity|Legendary}} rarity, capped at Level 1 in Friendly Battles. The update also added 6 new cards immediately: [[Royal Giant]], [[Three Musketeers]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Poison]], [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Princess]].
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] added 6 new cards immediately: [[Fire Spirit|Fire Spirits]], [[Furnace]], [[Guards]], [[Lava Hound]], [[Miner]], and [[Sparky]]. The update also changed the maximum Levels for King's Tower and Cards: King's Tower: 13 (from 12); {{Rarity|Common}}: 13 (from 12); {{Rarity|Rare}}: 11 (from 10); {{Rarity|Legendary}}: 5 (from 6). The number of {{Rarity|Epic}} cards needed to upgrade from Level 7 to Level 8 was also reduced to 200 cards (from 300). The Gold cost to upgrade them was also increased for Levels 2-8. It also gave [[Gems|Gem]] refunds for every card over the cap for players who had already collected their {{Rarity|Epic}} or {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards past the post-upgrade cap.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]] fixed the [[Experience]] gained from upgrading {{Rarity|Epic}} and {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]] added 4 new cards immediately: [[Ice Spirit]], [[Bowler]], [[The Log]], and [[Lumberjack]].
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]] added the [[Mega Minion]] immediately. The update also added 3 new cards over time: [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Ice Golem]], and [[Graveyard]].
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]] added 4 new cards over time: [[Tornado]], [[Elite Barbarians]], [[Clone]], and [[Electro Wizard]].
*On 15/12/2016, the [[Version History#December 2016 Update (15/12/2016)|December 2016 Update]] added 4 new cards over time: [[Dart Goblin]], [[Executioner]], [[Battle Ram]], and [[Goblin Gang]].
